# Betrayer's Bargain with the {2} additional cost paid (CR 601.2b, 118.8), four mana in all, and Bot1's Ornithopter is kept. Five damage
# leaves Bot2's Fortress Crab (3/6) alive with exactly five marked; the replacement lasts the turn (CR 611.2c), so a Lightning Bolt
# that then kills the Crab exiles it instead of putting it into the graveyard (CR 614.1a). A Mox Jet is no creature, so it is refused.

