Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Betrayer's Bargain
Lightning Bolt
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Fortress Crab
Island x16

